00:15:48.092 --> 00:15:51.694
- Let's go very utilitarian
here because I got a hard stop.

00:15:51.694 --> 00:15:53.145
- Go to CharityNavigator.org.

00:15:53.145 --> 00:15:56.665
- This I love. Go ahead.
CharityNavigator.org.

00:15:56.665 --> 00:16:01.277
- You can check out a charity,
however overhead is I would go

00:16:01.277 --> 00:16:04.483
