schools in your name.

00:18:04.936 --> 00:18:06.603
And seriously, you've been 
able to impact the world.

00:18:06.603 --> 00:18:07.894
- And not only that to be honest
with you, I've been able to

00:18:07.894 --> 00:18:09.666
impact other
things, not just this.

00:18:09.666 --> 00:18:11.135
Sit on boards and
do other things.

00:18:11.135 --> 00:18:13.360
It changed the way
that I thought about it.

00:18:13.360 --> 00:18:16.034
In the same way that it is
my hope and dream that a

00:18:16.034 --> 00:18:19.022
28-year-old hustler right now
who's made a couple bucks doing

00:18:19.022 --> 00:18:21.935
Snapchat filters 'cause he got
my advice 40 episodes ago to do

00:18:21.935 --> 00:18:25.131
that says you know what I'm good
at donate $28 right now and give

00:18:25.131 --> 00:18:27.493
