Or whatever.

00:18:27.493 --> 00:18:29.915
And by the way I don't judge,
you do what you want to do.

00:18:29.915 --> 00:18:31.387
You want to be 90 and
never give a dollar.

00:18:31.387 --> 00:18:33.859
Everybody does what they do.
- You're missing out.

00:18:33.859 --> 00:18:36.862
You can really have, it's
fun. It's a blessing to give.

00:18:36.862 --> 00:18:39.079
We were taught this growing up.

00:18:39.079 --> 00:18:42.346
You get to live vicariously
through all of the good,

00:18:42.346 --> 00:18:44.599
your time and 
your money is doing.

00:18:44.599 --> 00:18:45.710
It doesn't need to
be Charity: Water.

00:18:45.710 --> 00:18:47.230
- I get it.

00:18:47.230 --> 00:18:48.447
- It's a blast.

00:18:48.447 --> 00:18:50.199
- It's a blast.

00:18:50.199 --> 00:18:51.134
Go ahead, India.

