the community 4-8 times richer.

00:20:02.776 --> 00:20:04.464
It yields $4-8.

00:20:04.464 --> 00:20:06.615
Jobs are incredibly
important and that's one of the

00:20:06.615 --> 00:20:08.193
things that's attractive to us

00:20:08.193 --> 00:20:09.666
about water because 
without the time.

00:20:09.666 --> 00:20:10.628
- What's her name?
- [India] Her name is Melissa.

00:20:10.628 --> 00:20:12.308
- Melissa, thanks
for the work you do.

00:20:12.308 --> 00:20:14.104
- Yeah.
- Yeah.

